---
// Services Component
---

<section id="services" class="py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-gray-100">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<!-- Section Header -->
		<div class="text-center mb-14 fade-in-up">
			<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#116530] bg-emerald-100/60 border border-emerald-200/50 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full inline-block mb-3">
				Layanan Kami
			</span>
			<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
				Solusi Lengkap Kebutuhan Sepeda Anda
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-3.5 text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
				Mulai dari unit baru untuk seluruh keluarga, suku cadang resmi, hingga perawatan menyeluruh oleh mekanik berpengalaman.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- 3 Core Pillars (Clean Minimalist Cards) -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-7 items-stretch">
			<!-- Pillar 1: Sepeda & Mainan Anak -->
			<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200/70 hover:border-emerald-300/80 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between fade-in-up">
				<div>
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 text-[#116530] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
						<i class="fas fa-bicycle"></i>
					</div>
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider">Unit Lengkap</span>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-1.5 mb-3 text-gray-900">
						Sepeda & Mainan Anak
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
						Koleksi lengkap sepeda MTB, lipat, mini, balap, hingga sepeda anak dan mainan edukatif dengan jaminan kualitas terbaik.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-[#116530]">
					<span>Unit Siap Pakai & Disetel</span>
					<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[11px]"></i>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Pillar 2: Sparepart & Aksesoris -->
			<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200/70 hover:border-emerald-300/80 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between fade-in-up" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
				<div>
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 text-[#116530] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
						<i class="fas fa-cogs"></i>
					</div>
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider">100% Original</span>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-1.5 mb-3 text-gray-900">
						Sparepart & Komponen
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
						Suku cadang asli seperti drivetrain, rantai, ban, dan aksesoris keselamatan standar resmi untuk kenyamanan gowes harian.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-[#116530]">
					<span>Jaminan Produk Asli</span>
					<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[11px]"></i>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Pillar 3: Servis & Upgrade -->
			<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200/70 hover:border-emerald-300/80 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between fade-in-up" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
				<div>
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 text-[#116530] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6">
						<i class="fas fa-wrench"></i>
					</div>
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider">Mekanik Handal</span>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-1.5 mb-3 text-gray-900">
						Bengkel Servis & Upgrade
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
						Perawatan rutin, setel presisi rem dan perpindahan gigi (shifter), penggantian part, hingga rakitan kustom sesuai preferensi Anda.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-[#116530]">
					<span>Konsultasi & Pengerjaan Rapi</span>
					<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[11px]"></i>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
